Package: runnerscope
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, gh
Description: native GitHub Actions self-hosted runner desktop monitor
 RunnerScope is a native C/GTK desktop monitor for GitHub Actions runners.
 It uses pinned Infiltratr Common for theme policy, formatting, timing and
 durable state/configuration publication while GitHub CLI retains ownership
 of authentication credentials.
